<p>Might be worthwhile to read up some more on the effects of black holes and try and incorporate some elements that would be analogous to those effects.</p>
<p>EDIT: I feel like there's potentially good stuff hiding behind that [DATA EXPUNGED]. Just how <em>do</em> you get impregnated with a black hole?</p>

